<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta content="text/html; charset=windows-1252" http-equiv="content-type">
    <title>Blueberry Banana Waffles</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p><strong>Blueberry banana waffles</strong></p>
    <p>1 c flour</p>
    <p>1 tsp baking powder</p>
    <p>1 tsp salt</p>
    <p>2 ripe bananas</p>
    <p>2 eggs</p>
    <p>about 1 c buttermilk</p>
    <p>1-1.5 c blueberries</p>
    <p>Mix dry ingredients well.</p>
  </body>
</html>
